{"strongs": "H6944", "word": "מִקְדָּשׁ", "translit": "qo.desh", "root": "קדש", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "sacred place, sanctuary", "definition": "מִקְדָּשׁ noun masculine Amos 7:9 sacred place, sanctuary ; — ׳ מ Exod 25:8 +; מִקְּדָשׁ Exod 15:17 ( Ges «GKC:20h»§ 20h Kö ii. 1, 471 ); construct מִקְדַּשׁ Lev 16:33 +; suffix מִקְדָּשִׁי Lev 20:3 +, etc., מִקְדְּשׁוֺ Num 18:29 ( Kö ii. 1, 97 ); plural מִקְדָּשִׁים Ezek 21:7 , construct מִקְדְּשֵׁי Jer 51:51 + 2 t.; suffix מִקְדָּשַׁי Lev 21:23 מְקַדְשֵׁיהֶם Ezek 7:24 (on anomalous pointing see Ew § 215 a Hi -Sm; but probably Pi`el Participle was in mind, Ges «GKC:93oo»§ 93oo Anm.; < read מִקְדְּשֵׁיהֶם ); etc.; — 1. old Israel sanctuaries: of ׳ י at Shechem Josh 24:26 ( E ); probably also Exod 15:17 (i.e. Shiloh); plural of sanct. to be destroyed by ׳ י Lev 26:31 ( H ); ׳ מִקְדְּשֵׁי יִשׂ in Northern Israel Amos 7:9 מִקְדַּשׁמֶֿלֶךְ v Amos 7:13 (Bethel). 2. of the nations: Moab Isa 16:12 plural of Tyre Ezek 28:18 ( Co Toy [not Berthol Krae ] read קָדְשְׁךָ thy sanctity ). 3. tabernacle and its precincts Exod 25:8 ( P ) +; מִקְדַּשׁ הַקֹּדֶשׁ Lev 16:33 , plural Lev 21:23 . 4. temple and precincts 1Chr 22:19 ; Isa 63:18 ; Ps 74:7 +; בֵּית מִקְדָּשָׁם 2Chr 36:17 , מקדשׁ הבית Ezek 48:21 , ׳ מְכוֺן מ Dan 8:11 plural of many sacred places in and about the temple. ׳ מִקְדְּשֵׁי בית י Jer 51:51 מִקְדְּשֵׁי אֵל Ps 73:17 . Doubtful are: מִמִּקְדָּשֶׁיךָ Ps 68:36 ( ᵐ5 ἐν τοῖς ὁσίοις αὐτοῦ ᵑ9 de sanctuario ; SS מִקְדָּשֶׁ֑ךָ ); מִקְדָּשִׁים Ezek 21:7 ( ᵐ5 Co Berthol Buhl מִקְדָּשָׁם ; Toy Krae מִקְדָּשֶׁיהָ ; || יְרוּשָׁלַםִ ); וּמִקְדָּשׁ לַמִּקְדָּשׁ Ezek 45:4 b ( Co , after ᵐ5 , מִפְקָד לְקָדְשָׁם [ לְבָֽתֵּי ]; Toy וּלְמִגְרָשִׁים [ לְבָֽתִּים ], compare Krae לְמִגְרָשׁ ). 5. ׳ י will become ׳ לְמ for his people Ezek 11:16 ( Br MP 268 ), so apparently Isa 8:14 (but gloss Du Che Hpt Marti ; Lag Semitic i. 16 מִקָּשׁ i.e. stumbling-block [he compare Syriac strike ]). 6. of ׳ י 's future sanct., בתוכם לעולם ׳ מ Ezek 37:26 ; Ezek 37:28 . — ( מִמֶּנּוּ ) אֶתקּמִקְדְּשׁוֺ ( מִכָּלחֶֿלְבּוֺ ) Num 18:29 even the hallowed part there of AV RV , but this not the meaning of ׳ מ ; Ew § 255 c assumes מַ֗֗֗קְדֵּשׁ in this sense; < read קָדְשׁוֺ (see קֹדֶשׁ 3 d ), מִ being dittograph", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7328')\">BDB7328</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4720')\">H4720</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H6944')\">H6944</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7327')\">BDB7327</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7329')\">BDB7329</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מִקְדָּשׁ</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Amos 7:9\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,9)\">Amos 7:9</ref></sup> <highlightword>sacred place, sanctuary</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 25:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,8)\">Exod 25:8</ref> +; <bdbheb>מִקְּדָשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 15:17\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,17)\">Exod 15:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:20h»§ 20h</sup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>ii. 1, 471</sup></lookup>); construct <bdbheb>מִקְדַּשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 16:33\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,33)\">Lev 16:33</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>מִקְדָּשִׁי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 20:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,20,3)\">Lev 20:3</ref> +, etc., <bdbheb>מִקְדְּשׁוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 18:29\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,29)\">Num 18:29</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>ii. 1, 97</sup></lookup>); plural <bdbheb>מִקְדָּשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,7)\">Ezek 21:7</ref>, construct <bdbheb>מִקְדְּשֵׁי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 51:51\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,51)\">Jer 51:51</ref> + 2 t.; suffix <bdbheb>מִקְדָּשַׁי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 21:23\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(3,21,23)\">Lev 21:23</ref> <bdbheb>מְקַדְשֵׁיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 7:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,7,24)\">Ezek 7:24</ref> (on anomalous pointing see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew<sup>§ 215 a</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup>-Sm; but probably <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight> was in mind, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:93oo»§ 93oo</sup> Anm.; &lt; read <bdbheb>מִקְדְּשֵׁיהֶם</bdbheb>); etc.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> old Israel <highlight>sanctuaries:</highlight> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> at Shechem <ref ref=\"Josh 24:26\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(6,24,26)\">Josh 24:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); probably also <ref ref=\"Exod 15:17\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,17)\">Exod 15:17</ref> (i.e. Shiloh); plural of sanct. to be destroyed by <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 26:31\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,31)\">Lev 26:31</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִקְדְּשֵׁי יִשׂ</bdbheb> in Northern Israel <ref ref=\"Amos 7:9\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,9)\">Amos 7:9</ref> <bdbheb>מִקְדַּשׁמֶֿלֶךְ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Amos 7:13\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,13)\">Amos 7:13</ref> (Bethel). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> of the nations: Moab <ref ref=\"Isa 16:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,16,12)\">Isa 16:12</ref> plural of Tyre <ref ref=\"Ezek 28:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,28,18)\">Ezek 28:18</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> Toy [not <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Berthol')\">Berthol</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Krae')\">Krae</lookup>] read <bdbheb>קָדְשְׁךָ</bdbheb> <highlight>thy sanctity</highlight>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> tabernacle and its precincts <ref ref=\"Exod 25:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,8)\">Exod 25:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) +; <bdbheb>מִקְדַּשׁ הַקֹּדֶשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 16:33\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,33)\">Lev 16:33</ref>, plural <ref ref=\"Lev 21:23\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(3,21,23)\">Lev 21:23</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> temple and precincts <ref ref=\"1Chr 22:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,22,19)\">1Chr 22:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 63:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"63\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"63\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,63,18)\">Isa 63:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 74:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"74\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"74\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,74,7)\">Ps 74:7</ref> +; <bdbheb>בֵּית מִקְדָּשָׁם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,17)\">2Chr 36:17</ref>, <bdbheb>מקדשׁ הבית</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 48:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,48,21)\">Ezek 48:21</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מְכוֺן מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 8:11\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,11)\">Dan 8:11</ref> plural of many sacred places in and about the temple. <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִקְדְּשֵׁי בית י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 51:51\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,51)\">Jer 51:51</ref> <bdbheb>מִקְדְּשֵׁי אֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 73:17\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,17)\">Ps 73:17</ref>. Doubtful are: <bdbheb>מִמִּקְדָּשֶׁיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 68:36\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,36)\">Ps 68:36</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>ἐν τοῖς ὁσίοις αὐτοῦ</grk> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <highlight>de sanctuario</highlight>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SS')\">SS</lookup> <bdbheb>מִקְדָּשֶׁ֑ךָ</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>מִקְדָּשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,7)\">Ezek 21:7</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Berthol')\">Berthol</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl</lookup> <bdbheb>מִקְדָּשָׁם</bdbheb>; Toy <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Krae')\">Krae</lookup> <bdbheb>מִקְדָּשֶׁיהָ</bdbheb>; || <bdbheb>יְרוּשָׁלַםִ</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>וּמִקְדָּשׁ לַמִּקְדָּשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 45:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,45,4)\">Ezek 45:4</ref>b (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>, after <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>, <bdbheb>מִפְקָד לְקָדְשָׁם</bdbheb> [<bdbheb>לְבָֽתֵּי</bdbheb>]; Toy <bdbheb>וּלְמִגְרָשִׁים</bdbheb> [<bdbheb>לְבָֽתִּים</bdbheb>], compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Krae')\">Krae</lookup> <bdbheb>לְמִגְרָשׁ</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> will become <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><